hume-enquiry-3.logic.r1: argue/readings: what the text leaves unstated is read 2 ways: hume-enquiry-3.logic.r1 has "certain_no_hand_fire → moral_inference_certain"; hume-enquiry-3.logic.r1.2 and hume-enquiry-3.logic.r1.3 have "certain_no_hand_fire ∧ frenzy_no_possibility → moral_inference_certain"; they differ when only "I know with certainty that he is not to put his hand into the fire and hold it there till it be consumed" is true, which the second allows
